  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> The GM-facing oracle adds 1d4 to their own Wisdom ability checks, such as a secret search or hidden observation. The bonus card is hidden and the bonus roll uses blind-roll visibility; this cannot conceal a roll or chat message that was already public.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
